menu "P1S Heat Controller"

config P1S_WIFI_SSID
    string "Wi-Fi SSID"
    default ""
    help
        Name of the network the controller joins at boot. The controller is
        station-only, so a board built without this never reaches the network
        and its web UI stays unreachable. Heat regulation is unaffected.

        Supply this through the gitignored sdkconfig.secret, never through
        sdkconfig.defaults, which is tracked in Git.

config P1S_WIFI_PASSWORD
    string "Wi-Fi password"
    default ""
    help
        WPA2 passphrase for P1S_WIFI_SSID: either 8 to 63 bytes, or empty for
        an open network. Any other length is rejected at startup.

        Supply this through the gitignored sdkconfig.secret, never through
        sdkconfig.defaults, which is tracked in Git.

endmenu
